flowchart LR
    subgraph Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
        App[App registration]
        SP[Existing Enterprise application<br/>Entra service principal]
        Token[App-only token]
        Removed[Broad Graph grant<br/>removed manually]
        App --> SP
        SP --> Token
        SP -.-> Removed
    end

    subgraph Exchange[Exchange Online App RBAC]
        Pointer[Exchange service-principal pointer<br/>not a second Entra SP]
        Role[Application role assignment<br/>Application Mail.Read or Mail.Send]
        Scope[Resource scope<br/>Management Scope or Administrative Unit]
        Group[Mail-enabled security group<br/>when using MemberOfGroup]
        Auth[Exchange authorization]
        Allowed[Allowed mailbox<br/>in scope]
        Denied[Other mailbox<br/>out of scope]
        Pointer --> Role
        Role --> Scope
        Group --> Scope
        Scope --> Auth
        Auth -->|Allowed| Allowed
        Auth -.->|403 denied| Denied
    end

    SP -.->|Object ID pointer| Pointer
    Token -->|Graph mailbox request| Auth